                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c9410704-ef42-3c0f-9d25-6389e76e1d66",
                        "entry_id": "12574d2d-53bc-3ab8-b7f8-e67a8746ad31",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Clipping of infrastructure."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "abbreviation",
                            "alt-of",
                            "clipping",
                            "countable",
                            "informal",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "38f188d2-c64e-4b71-8712-7adecb5dfd8c",
                                "sense_id": "c9410704-ef42-3c0f-9d25-6389e76e1d66",
                                "text": "However, as the nations 70% is^([sic]) covered with mountains, gathering of the meteorological information of particular regions (mountains, canyons, islands etc) by wired transmission system is difficult and it costs a lot of money. This is one of the obstacles of the construction of an infra for the prevention of disasters caused by meteorological changes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d06d5aab-f512-4ef0-abc1-de3373ba2374",
                                "sense_id": "c9410704-ef42-3c0f-9d25-6389e76e1d66",
                                "text": "In this paper we focus on the context of infra construction and development – the problem being: lack of relevant tools for management of BIM [building information modelling] implementation actions."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0db60851-a622-43d9-b8ff-a9d7ebbc694e",
                                "sense_id": "c9410704-ef42-3c0f-9d25-6389e76e1d66",
                                "text": "Technologies in cloud computing have become mature in the infra systems and cloud server-level service providers, which have kept the infra system technologies as the data centers, server clusters, virtualization, service providers by extending services of Private Cloud."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "540437e9-1197-4ac1-9086-39db24c3e050",
                                "sense_id": "c9410704-ef42-3c0f-9d25-6389e76e1d66",
                                "text": "(Last year Zuckerberg announced a new engineering slogan: “Move fast with stable infra,” using the hacker shorthand for the infrastructure that keeps the site running.)"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
